'''Monferno''' (Japanese: '''モウカザル''' ''Moukazaru'') is a {{ct|Fire}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion.

