==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Plasma Storm|Monferno|16}} from the {{TCG|Plasma Storm}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Monferno}}.
*'''Fiery Punch''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Brilliant Stars|Magmar|19}} from the {{TCG|Brilliant Stars}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

